-/**
- * β-11: ApprovePlanModal — UX foundation for plan-first / execute-second.
- *
- * 4-state UX:
- *  - View   (read-only list of steps)
- *  - Edit   (inline JSON editor for editable step params)
- *  - Reject (close without execute)
